---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service - சேவை விதிமுறைகள் | FYC Connect"
  description="Terms of Service and Community Guidelines for FYC Connect Platform & Friends Youth Club"
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden text-white" style="min-height:180px;background:#030C06;">
    <div class="aurora-bg absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
      <div class="aurora-blob-1" style="position:absolute;left:-60px;top:-60px;width:300px;height:300px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(15,81,50,0.60);"></div>
      <div class="aurora-blob-2" style="position:absolute;right:-40px;top:20px;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(22,163,74,0.35);"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center py-12 px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-green-100 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Last updated: August 2026 · Friends Youth Club (FYC Connect)
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-12 px-4 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using the FYC Connect mobile app or website (<a href="https://fycconnect.com" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">fycconnect.com</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the application.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Purpose of the Platform</h2>
        <p>
          FYC Connect is a non-profit community engagement platform created by Friends Youth Club to organize local youth initiatives, sports tournaments, blood donation registries, green drives, and civic issue tracking in Nagercoil and surrounding communities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. User Conduct and Responsibilities</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Accurate Information:</strong> You agree to provide accurate phone and contact details during verification.</li>
          <li><strong>Respectful Communication:</strong> All posts, event discussions, and community reports must remain civil, respectful, and free of abusive or unlawful content.</li>
          <li><strong>Voluntary Blood Donation:</strong> Blood donation registry is strictly voluntary and life-saving. Misuse or prank calls to blood donors is strictly prohibited.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Intellectual Property & Brand</h2>
        <p>
          The names "Friends Youth Club", "FYC Connect", associated logos, designs, and content are the property of Friends Youth Club.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          The platform and services are provided on an "as is" basis for community benefit without warranties of any kind. FYC is not liable for indirect or incidental damages resulting from platform usage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Contact Information</h2>
        <div class="mt-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 text-sm">
          <p><strong>Friends Youth Club (FYC)</strong></p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:vrn2252@gmail.com" class="text-primary font-medium">vrn2252@gmail.com</a></p>
          <p>Website: <a href="https://fycconnect.com" class="text-primary font-medium">https://fycconnect.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
